# EigenScript gap: no inf/nan. Division by zero raises, overflow saturates at
# +/-1e308 (EigenScript#1286 row "One overloaded number type").
# Lua:      print(1/0, -1/0, 1e308 * 10, 0/0 ~= 0/0) -> inf  -inf  inf  true
#           math.huge -> inf
# Expected: IEEE inf/-inf/nan values (Lua's float semantics), or a loud
#           refusal; EigenLua refuses (exit 3) rather than print 1e308.
# Actual v0.44.0:  1e+308 for 1e308 * 10 (silent), and 1 / 0 raises
#           "division by zero".
# Rows: num_print (D); any program touching math.huge or x/0.
print of (1e308 * 10)
try:
    print of (1 / 0)
catch e:
    print of e.message
